10 REM WALKER: A SPRITE SHEET OVER A JPEG BACKDROP. ARROWS TURN, Q QUITS
20 PICTURE "VALLEY.JPG"
30 SHEET 0, "WALKER.PNG", 24, 32 PALETTE 232
40 X = 300: D = 1: F = 0
50 K$ = INKEY$
60 IF K$ = CHR$(130) THEN D = -1
70 IF K$ = CHR$(131) THEN D = 1
80 IF K$ = "Q" OR K$ = "q" THEN 140
90 X = X + D * 2: IF X < 0 THEN X = 0: D = 1
100 IF X > 616 THEN X = 616: D = -1
110 F = (F + 1) MOD 32
120 SPRITE 0 FRAME 0, F \ 4, -(D < 0): SPRITE 0 AT X, 296: VSYNC
130 GOTO 50
140 SPRITE 0 OFF: VSYNC: TEXT
